Do you feel dizzy, poisoned, or gag when smoking, but love the smell & coffee-hit of cigarettes as you retrohale?



* Get checked for H. pylori, stomach acid issues,
  food intolerances like gluten & dairy, and bad stool.

* Some days, smoke a bit of handmade cigar before smoking cigarettes.
  (Cigarettes can act as gastrointestinal stimulants which can lead
  to bad stool. Having cigars or pipe tobacco before cigarettes keeps
  my gastrointestinal tract relaxed. You can save cigar leftovers in a
  separate non-humidified container and smoke them in a tobacco pipe).
